8	/**
9	 * Rejects 409 when the built owner shares another owner's {@link IdentityKey}. This one check
10	 * replaces the former separate telephone, email and household duplicate checks: an owner collides
11	 * only on an exact match of the telephone-and-email identity, so two members of one household with
12	 * different telephones (or different emails) are both allowed.
