Computed-expectation helpers replicating the production algorithms (these are the reference SHA-256 / Luhn implementations tests compare against):

```java
/** Full lower-case hex SHA-256 of the UTF-8 bytes of s. */
protected static String sha256hex(String s) {
    byte[] digest = MessageDigest.getInstance("SHA-256").digest(s.getBytes(StandardCharsets.UTF_8));
    ... String.format("%02x", b) ...   // lower-case hex
}
/** First n UPPER-case hex characters of SHA-256(s). */
protected static String shaHex(String s, int n) { return sha256hex(s).substring(0, n).toUpperCase(); }
